  "configuration_id": "config_036",
  "reason": "The strongest evidence so far is that RNA-only multiprofile scvi_n200 with avgpool or transformer aggregation performs best, while image-only multiprofile avgpool is weak, with imagenet_vit_l slightly better than resnet50 on F1. The main uncertainty is whether adding image features to the strong RNA baseline improves performance. config_036 tests this with a simple concat fusion while holding the RNA encoder, profile setting, and aggregation fixed, and it uses the image encoder with the better image-only F1. This makes it the most informative next experiment for isolating the contribution of image fusion before trying more complex fusion or alternative RNA encoders."
}

